{"title":"Ashby the Quartermaster","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\">\n      <p class=\"wp-lede\">Ashby the Quartermaster is a trainer — a named <a href=\"#/monster/footpad\">Footpad</a> seen at level 8.</p>\n      \n      \n      <h2>Where to find Ashby the Quartermaster</h2>\n      \n      <ul class=\"wp-list\"><li>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Rustpick%20Mine\">Rustpick Mine</a></li></ul>\n      \n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"npc\" data-map-id=\"ashby-the-quartermaster\">Show on map</button>\n      \n      <h2>Drops</h2><div class=\"collector-extra\"><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"carters-strongbox\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/b6451acaa9136821bd2c.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Carters Strongbox</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1 drop</span></div></div></div>\n      <h2>Other named Footpads</h2><p><a href=\"#/npc/bandit-footpad\">Bandit Footpad</a> · <a href=\"#/npc/wil-ashby\">Wil Ashby</a></p>\n    </div><aside class=\"wp-infobox\"><div class=\"wp-pic\"><img src=\"data/img/0d647be846757b58c574.webp\" alt=\"\"></div><h3>Ashby the Quartermaster</h3><table>\n      <tr><th>Kind</th><td><a href=\"#/monster/footpad\">Footpad</a></td></tr><tr><th>Role</th><td>trainer</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Level</th><td>8</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Hitpoints</th><td>26</td></tr><tr><th>Seen</th><td>5 times</td></tr>\n    </table></aside></article>"}